# Handoff notes

When the user mentions a handoff, starts from a prior session, or asks to wrap up:

1. Look under `notes/handoff/` (and only recurse further if that directory is missing or empty).
2. Use the interactive question tool to ask whether notes are outdated.
3. If outdated, ask permission before removing. If still valid, read them and summarise your understanding.

Never save handoff notes in `/tmp` (or `$TMPDIR`): it is cleared on reboot. Save under `notes/handoff/`, and move anything still needed out of `/tmp` into the repo before ending the session.
